  "gist": "MOFCOM is tightening how it handles tip-offs about export-control breaches involving dual-use strategic minerals. Anyone, whether a company or an individual, may report. This excerpt lists the first eight kinds of reportable conduct: exporting without a licence or beyond its terms, exporting banned items, evading controls by modifying goods or routing them through third countries, illegally transferring technology, servicing exporters you know are breaking the rules, and helping others evade the controls.",
